ots 1
# netplay-crossplay, player 1 (the C engine in `cargo xtask crossplay`). Real clock: the
# times are milliseconds since this peer started; both peers start together.
# "Waiting for other player", then episode select: Episode 1
@3000 key-down RETURN
@3060 key-up RETURN
# difficulty select: Normal
@4800 key-down RETURN
@4860 key-up RETURN
# network Game Menu: Play Next Level ("Waiting for other player" until player 2 does too)
@9000 key-down RETURN
@9060 key-up RETURN
# level 1 (starts at ~10 s): fire and strafe
@14000 key-down SPACE
@14000 key-down LEFT
@15000 key-up LEFT
@16300 key-down RIGHT
@18300 key-up RIGHT
@19600 key-down UP
@20100 key-up UP
@24400 key-down LEFT
@25900 key-up LEFT
@26200 key-up SPACE
